00:55:45.759 --> 00:55:47.010
[exhales heavily]

764
00:55:48.178 --> 00:55:49.262
It's damn cold.

765
00:55:50.722 --> 00:55:52.724
Even a corpse
would freeze to death in here.

766
00:55:53.850 --> 00:55:54.934
[exhales]

767
00:56:02.817 --> 00:56:05.111
Where the hell did they put it? Huh?

768
00:56:06.863 --> 00:56:09.365
[suspenseful music plays]

769
