775
00:56:47.112 --> 00:56:48.863
[door closes]

776
00:56:58.873 --> 00:57:01.376
-[buzzing continues]
-[sighs]

777
00:57:02.710 --> 00:57:05.171
Oh. wow. Hey. Chairman.

778
00:57:05.255 --> 00:57:07.090
I can't believe you called me directly.

779
00:57:08.007 --> 00:57:09.008
You doing good?

780
00:57:09.884 --> 00:57:14.139
I mean. I know you're stuffing your face
