784
00:57:25.400 --> 00:57:27.569
<i>Oh. please.</i>
<i>She doesn't owe me anything. sir.</i>

785
00:57:27.652 --> 00:57:28.528
<i>It was nothing.</i>

786
00:57:28.611 --> 00:57:32.532
I kind of miss that little princess.
Is she doing well?

787
00:57:33.032 --> 00:57:36.161
You know.
She really is just like you. sir.

788
00:57:36.244 --> 00:57:39.789
I bet you're proud of your daughter
becoming such a great killer.

789
00:57:39.873 --> 00:57:42.459
Oh. and she even knows
who to call afterwards.

790
00:57:42.542 --> 00:57:45.628
You know you've really earned
the title of Father of The Year.

791
00:57:46.463 --> 00:57:47.547
Let's meet. asshole.

792
