793
00:57:50.633 --> 00:57:55.472
But Gang-chan. you better start treating
me with a little respect. asshole.

794
00:57:56.014 --> 00:57:57.474
<i>Can't you see what's going on?</i>

795
00:57:58.766 --> 00:58:00.560
<i>I'm about to send you an address.</i>

796
00:58:00.643 --> 00:58:04.939
After this call. go there
with two billion won in cold hard cash.

797
00:58:05.815 --> 00:58:07.817
And don't bring any of your goons.

798
00:58:07.901 --> 00:58:09.527
<i>Come alone or it's off.</i>

799
00:58:10.069 --> 00:58:11.321
<i>Oh. and one more thing.</i>

800
00:58:11.821 --> 00:58:13.907
Go pull out all of Nam's teeth

801
00:58:14.657 --> 00:58:16.618
and give them to me as a gift. okay?

802
00:58:16.701 --> 00:58:18.828
[inhales sharply]
Can you send a picture of you doing it?

803
00:58:19.329 --> 00:58:22.165
Tell him I'll give him private lessons
on how to talk without his teeth

804
00:58:22.248 --> 00:58:24.125
cause I've learned a few tricks
along the way.

805
00:58:24.209 --> 00:58:25.752
[chuckles]

806
00:58:27.420 --> 00:58:28.630
[call disconnects]

807
