831
01:01:08.247 --> 01:01:11.042
{\an8}[Kim] <i>If it's true that my Min-ji is dead.</i>
<i>none of youâ€¦</i>

832
01:01:12.335 --> 01:01:13.503
{\an8}<i>will make it out of here.</i>

833
01:01:14.128 --> 01:01:15.254
{\an8}[Min-ji] <i>I'm sorry. Dad.</i>

834
01:01:15.338 --> 01:01:17.131
{\an8}-[Kim] <i>Min-ji isâ€¦</i>
-[thunderclap]

